 the check-in date are selectable.\n   521→\n   522→#### Test: Guest count cannot exceed property max_guests\n   523→- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page for a property with max_guests 4.\n   524→- **Action:** User tries to set the guest count higher than 4.\n   525→- **Expected:** The guest count selector prevents selecting more than 4 guests. The maximum is capped at 4.\n   526→\n...\n</persisted-output>"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ku8J7eurhAtADnCzyj19gD","session_id":"e9cade60-94a4-4669-9ce9-af24d9b0f1dc","uuid":"cd355a8b-2b7d-49f2-baeb-0ffaa1ff3025"}
