pected outcomes\n- Validation rules\n- Edge cases\n- Error handling scenarios\n\n### 5. **AppStyle.md** - Not Found\nNo AppStyle.md file exists in `/repo/apps/` or within the AirbnbClone app directory.\n\n### 6. **Existing Source Files Content**\n\n**src/App.tsx** (22 lines)\n- React Router setup with 6 routes\n- Routes: /login, /, /properties/:id, /trips, /hosting, /profile\n\n**src/store.ts** (26 lines)\n- Redux store configuration with 8 slices:\n  - auth, properties, favorites, amenities, propertyDetail, bookings, host, userReviews\n\n**src/main.tsx** (18 lines)\n- React DOM root setup with Redux Provider and BrowserRouter\n\n**src/index.css** (41 lines)\n- Tailwind CSS import\n- Theme variables (colors: primary #FF5A5F, bg, text, status badges, etc.)\n- Global styles: margins, padding, box-sizing, fonts, links\n\n### 7. **Netlify Functions** - Database Schema from Functions\n\nAll netlify functions are present and use Neon PostgreSQL via `@neondatabase/serverless`. Key database operations:\n\n**Database Tables Inferred:**\n- `users` - id, email, name, avatar_url, bio, phone, is_host, created_at\n- `properties` - id, host_id, title, description, property_type, price_per_night, cleaning_fee, max_guests, bedrooms, beds, bathrooms, address, city, state, country, latitude, longitude, check_in_time, check_out_time, is_active, created_at, updated_at\n- `property_images` - id, property_id, url, caption, display_order\n- `amenities` - id, name, icon, category\n- `property_amenities` - property_id, amenity_id (join table)\n- `bookings` - id, property_id, guest_id, check_in, check_out, num_guests, total_price, status, special_requests, created_at\n- `reviews` - id, booking_id, property_id, guest_id, rating, cleanliness, accuracy, communication, location, value, comment, created_at\n- `favorites` - user_id, property_id, created_at\n\n**Functions Overview:**\n- `auth.ts` - POST login/register by email\n- `users.ts` - GET/PUT user, POST become-host\n- `properties.ts` - GET/POST/PUT/DELETE properties with complex filtering\n- `property-images.ts` - POST/DELETE property images\n- `bookings.ts` - POST/PUT/GET bookings with availability checking\n- `reviews.ts` - GET/POST reviews by guest or property\n- `favorites.ts` - GET/POST/DELETE favorites\n- `host-bookings.ts` - GET bookings for host's properties\n- `host-listings.ts` - GET host's listings with ratings\n- `host-stats.ts` - GET host statistics (listings, bookings, earnings, ratings)\n- `amenities.ts` - GET amenities list\n\n### 8. **No schema.ts File Found**\nNo `scripts/schema.ts` file exists in the project. The database schema is defined directly in the Netlify functions through their SQL queries.\n\nThis is a complete, fully-specified Airbnb clone application with comprehensive test coverage and robust backend API implementation."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a73b6295092b59b9b (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 64680\ntool_uses: 35\nduration_ms: 90473</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e9cade60-94a4-4669-9ce9-af24d9b0f1dc","uuid":"5306e070-9111-4daa-808c-a6f803165dc1","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Find the airbnb-clone app directory under /repo/apps/. I need to know:\n1. What's the exact app directory name?\n2. List all files in the app directory recursively\n3. Read the AppSpec.md file\n4. Read docs/tests.md if it exists\n5. Read any AppStyle.md files (both in apps/ root and app-specific)\n6. Read the existing src/App.tsx, src/store.ts, src/main.tsx, src/index.css files\n7. Read the existing netlify/functions/ files\n8. Read scripts/schema.ts for the database schema\n\nBe very thorough - I need the full content of AppSpec.md and tests.md especially.","agentId":"a73b6295092b59b9b","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Great! Now I have all the information you requested. Let me provide you with a comprehensive summary:\n\n## AirbnbClone App - Complete Information\n\n### 1. **Exact App Directory Name**\